{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":16,"ref":"psalms 69:16","book":"psalms","lang":"de","chapter":69,"translation":"Kein Wildbach von Wasser soll mich fortreißen, und die Tiefe soll mich nicht verschlingen, und die Grube soll nicht über mir ihren Mund verschließen!","tokens":[{"surface":"אל","gloss":"Nicht"},{"surface":"תשטפני","gloss":"soll mich fortreißen"},{"surface":"שבלת","gloss":"Wildbach"},{"surface":"מים","gloss":"von Wasser"},{"surface":"ואל","gloss":"und nicht"},{"surface":"תבלעני","gloss":"soll verschlingen"},{"surface":"מצולה","gloss":"die Tiefe"},{"surface":"ואל","gloss":"und nicht"},{"surface":"תאטר","gloss":"soll verschließen"},{"surface":"עלי","gloss":"über mir"},{"surface":"באר","gloss":"die Grube"},{"surface":"פיה","gloss":"ihren Mund"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-06T04:15:30.370467909Z","model":"glm-5.2"}